  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/forgeconfigapiport/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/forgeconfigapiport/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/forgeconfigapiport/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config API Port</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 是一個開發者程式庫，將 Forge 和 NeoForge 的配置系統引入其他模組載入器。它允許模組在 Fabric、Forge 和 NeoForge 上使用熟悉的 Forge 或 NeoForge 風格配置，而無需維護單獨的配置實現。📦</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">此模組旨在供模組開發人員使用，並作為受支援模組的依賴項。它不允許 Forge 模組在 Fabric 上運行，也不提供載入器之間任何形式的通用模組相容性。🔧</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">通過盡可能保留原始 API、套件名稱和行為，該模組使得維護多載入器專案和在平台間共享配置代碼變得更加容易。這有助於減少特定平台的代碼，並在受支援的模組載入器之間保持配置處理的一致性。🔄</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/forgeconfigapiport/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">配置程式庫：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">將 Forge 和 NeoForge 的配置系統引入其他模組載入器，同時保留其熟悉的 API。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔄 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">跨載入器配置支援：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在 Fabric 和 NeoForge 上使用 Forge 配置，或在 Fabric 和 Forge 上使用 NeoForge 配置。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧩 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">無需重構：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">保留原始套件名稱和類別名稱，允許現有配置實現以最少或無需更改代碼的方式進行移植。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏗️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">專為多載入器專案設計：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在共享的公共模組中定義和註冊配置，而不是維護單獨的平台特定實現。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">♻️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">共享配置代碼：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在受支援的載入器之間保持單一配置設置，減少重複並簡化維護。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚡ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">原生支援（如可用）：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在已內建所選配置系統的載入器上，不需要額外的程式庫，將用戶的依賴項降至最低。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/forgeconfigapiport/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端與伺服器均需安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> （Fabric 版）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/forgeconfigapiport/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/credits/headers.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 Forge 和 NeoForge 團隊創建並維護本專案所基於的配置 API！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/forgeconfigapiport/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/eternal-nether\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/pick-up-notifier\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fantastic-wings\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fantasticwings/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/forgeconfigapiport/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
